From 4b89ba57ec9e5d85d7ea50cf2a1d96a4b78d2776 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bench <bench@local>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:31:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] null patch: 74-step-up-bound-from-landing-box

Entity#collide (1.21.11) builds step candidates from the box after the downward part of the move when the entity was pushed down onto ground, and caps the ledge at the step height above that box. The fork swept 0.6 above the start box.
---
